{"diagnosis": "Trace shows fetch starvation with max_addr=0x00000000 and FAIL 0xdead instead of advancing through 256 NOPs. Expected mem_do_rdata to clear to 0 on !resetn||mem_done to allow next mem_do_rinst, but picorv32.v:1952 sets it to 1. This holds data-phase active and blocks instruction fetch, causing the 2009-cycle no-progress trap.", "patch_diff": "diff --git a/picorv32.v b/picorv32.v
--- a/picorv32.v
+++ b/picorv32.v
@@ -1949,6 +1949,6 @@
 		if (!resetn || mem_done) begin
 			mem_do_prefetch <= 0;
 			mem_do_rinst <= 0;
-			mem_do_rdata <= 1;
+			mem_do_rdata <= 0;
 			mem_do_wdata <= 0;
 		end
", "expected": "tohost PASS with max_addr != 0x00000000 and no TRAP: no progress"}

